  "title": "First Baby Food: Peas",
  "description": "Peas make a great baby food pureed with breast milk, formula, or water. Easy to make ahead and freeze for an easy-to-digest first food for your baby!",
  "authors": [
    "Brenda Michelle Ratliff"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-05-08T02:27:24-04:00",
